    <description><![CDATA[## Install

```powershell
choco install ms-apm
```

Chocolatey downloads the official 64-bit archive at install time, unpacks it into the package tools directory and shims the executables it contains. The package itself carries no binaries.

Install a specific version:

```powershell
choco install ms-apm --version=<version>
```

## What is Agent Package Manager?

Agent Package Manager

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade ms-apm
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall ms-apm
```

